# Local development secrets for the SG Car Buddy Worker.
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. Read by BOTH `npm run dev` (wrangler) and `npm run dev:node`.
# Production: `npm run setup` uploads the non-empty LTA_ACCOUNT_KEY, DATAGOVSG_API_KEY, ONEMAP_EMAIL and
# ONEMAP_PASSWORD from this file as Cloudflare secrets (ALLOWED_ORIGINS and CF_* are never uploaded).
# Never commit real values, and never put these in mobile/.env* (everything there ships inside the APK).

# REQUIRED — LTA DataMall AccountKey (carpark lots, EV chargers, traffic cameras, incidents, travel times, flood alerts).
# Apply: https://datamall.lta.gov.sg/content/datamall/en/request-for-api.html  (purpose: Mobile APP)
LTA_ACCOUNT_KEY=

# RECOMMENDED — data.gov.sg API key (HDB carpark details and totals, NEA rain radar and weather). Works without it on the
# public tier (6 calls / 10 s); a production key allows 30 calls / 10 s.
# Get one: https://data.gov.sg → sign in → Dashboard → API keys
DATAGOVSG_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — OneMap account (free) for postal-code / place search. Works without it today, but OneMap
# is moving to token-only access. Register: https://www.onemap.gov.sg/apidocs/register
ONEMAP_EMAIL=
ONEMAP_PASSWORD=

# OPTIONAL — URA Data Service AccessKey: exact URA carpark rates and capacity. Without it the app estimates URA carparks
# with URA's standard coupon rates. Register: https://eservice.ura.gov.sg/maps/api/  (emailed AccessKey)
URA_ACCESS_KEY=

# Local dev only: allow any browser origin (e.g. a phone on your Wi-Fi opening http://<your-ip>:5173).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*

# OPTIONAL — only for `npm run usage` (today's requests vs the free 100k/day). Never uploaded as a secret.
# (Deliberately not named CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, so wrangler never mistakes this read-only token for its login.)
#   CF_ACCOUNT_ID: `npx wrangler whoami`, or dashboard → Workers & Pages (right sidebar)
#   CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN:  dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token → "Read analytics and logs"
CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
